docs {
  # B2C Callback
  
  Receives Business to Customer payment result callbacks.
  
  ## When Called
  After B2C payment is processed (successful or failed).
  
  ## ResultCodes
  - 0: Success
  - Other codes indicate various failure reasons
  
  **Note**: Called by Safaricom servers after B2C payment processing.
}
